WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.209
Day 2. Two small words, put together.

2
00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:09.471
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.971 --> 00:00:14.840
Start with a small word your child can read. Then a second small word joins it.

4
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:19.527
The word is sun.

5
00:00:26.476 --> 00:00:27.624
The word is sunset.

6
00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:32.299
On the page, a thin dashed line shows the split between the beats.

7
00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:37.929
There are cards to cut out on the next page. Each one shows a long word in its two beats.

8
00:00:38.379 --> 00:00:42.935
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

9
00:00:43.385 --> 00:00:49.586
Do the four pairs of job one together. The short word first, then the long word, one beat at a time.

10
00:00:50.036 --> 00:00:54.069
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

11
00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:59.247
Cover the second beat with a finger. Read the first one. Then uncover the rest.

12
00:01:00.047 --> 00:01:05.620
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

13
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.532
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
